\v 25 They¦63351 must¦63351 carry¦63351 the \add inner\add* curtains¦63354 from the \add ≈sacred¦63355 tent¦63355\add*, the covering, the \add ?≈fine\add* leather¦63362 covering, the entrance¦63370 curtain,
\v 26 the courtyard curtains, and the courtyard gate¦63383 curtain, along with the ropes¦63394 and other equipment for using them. That will be their ministry.
\v 27 Aharon¦63412 and his¦63413 sons¦63413 \add ≈will¦63414 direct\add* the Gershonites¦63419 in¦63427 their¦63424 duties and assign¦63425 all¦63423 \add the items\add* to¦63426 them¦63426.
\v 28 That will be the ministry of Gershon's descendants¦63436 with¦63438 the \add ≈sacred¦63438 tent¦63438\add*, and¦63440 it will all be under the supervision of Aharon's¦63445 son¦63443 Itamar¦63442 the priest¦63446.
