\v 29 “\add ≈Take a detailed census\add* of¦63449 Merari's¦63450 descendants¦63449 by their¦63451 clans¦63451 and families,
\v 30 listing the men who are from thirty¦63459 to fifty¦63465 years¦63460 old and who goes into the \add ≈sacred¦63476 tent¦63476\add* to minister.
\v 31 Their¦63484 duties are carrying¦63481 the frames¦63487, crossbars, posts, and¦63479 sockets for the \add ≈sacred¦63488 tent¦63488\add*,
\v 32 the courtyard¦63494 pillars¦63493 and their bases¦63496, their pegs¦63497 and ropes¦63498, and all¦63502 their equipment. Every¦63499 man must be assigned¦63505 by¦63504 name¦63504 as to¦63502 what equipment he must carry¦63510.
\v 33 That will be the ministry of Merari's¦63516 descendants¦63515 with¦63520 the \add ≈sacred¦63520 tent¦63520\add*, and it will all¦63517 be under the supervision of Aharon's¦63526 son¦63524 Itamar¦63523 the priest¦63527.
