\v 36 and¦63559 the total for all the clans¦63561 was 2,750.
\v 37 That was from the Kohatite clans¦63569 who¦63573 ministered at¦63574 the \add ≈sacred¦63574 tent¦63574\add* and were listed by¦63584 Mosheh and Aharon¦63579 just as Yahweh¦63583 had instructed Mosheh.
\v 38 They counted¦63589 the Gershonites by their¦63592 clans¦63592 and¦63593 families,
\v 39 \add counting\add* the men from thirty¦63597 to fifty¦63603 years¦63598 old who¦63607 go into the \add ≈sacred¦63610 tent¦63610\add* to minister,
\v 40 and¦63613 the total for all the clans¦63615 was 2,630.
\v 41 That was from the Gershonite clans¦63625 who¦63630 ministered at¦63631 the \add ≈sacred¦63631 tent¦63631\add* and were listed by Mosheh and Aharon¦63636 just as Yahweh¦63640 had instructed Mosheh.
\v 42 They counted¦63642 the Merarites by their¦63646 clans¦63646 and¦63642 families,
