\v 45 That was from the Merarite clans¦63676 who ministered at¦63687 the \add ≈sacred tent\add* and were listed by¦63687 Mosheh and Aharon¦63682 just as Yahweh¦63686 had instructed Mosheh.
\v 46 \add ≈So¦63699\add* Mosheh¦63696, Aharon¦63697, and the Israeli¦63698 leaders¦63698 counted \add all\add* the Levites¦63702 by their¦63703 clans¦63703 and families,
