\v 24 \add ≈So¦67921\add* Mosheh¦67922 went¦67921 out¦67921 and \add ≈passed on\add* Yahweh's¦67929 message¦67928 to¦67924 the people¦67926. Then¦67921 he¦67930 gathered¦67930 seventy¦67931 men from the \add ≈Israeli\add* elders¦67933 and stood them¦67936 around¦67937 the tent¦67938.
