\p
\v 26 Two¦67967 of the men¦67969 who were listed (named Eldad¦67975 and Meydad¦67978), had remained¦67966 in the \add main\add* camp (not going¦67985 to the \add sacred\add* tent¦67986), and the spirit¦67981 had \add also\add* rested¦67979 on¦67971 them and they prophesied¦67987 in the camp.
