\v 28 Then¦68000 Nun's¦68004 son¦68002 Yehoshua¦68001 (who had helped Mosheh since his¦68007 youth¦68007) \add ≈responded¦68000\add*, “My¦68009 master¦68009 Mosheh, stop them¦68011 \add from that\add*.”
