\v 29 \add ≈But¦68013\add* Mosheh¦68015 replied, “Are¦68017 you¦68017 being jealous¦68016 \add ≈on my behalf\add*? \add ≈I'd¦68029 be happy if\add* Yahweh¦68024 would put¦68028 his¦68032 spirit¦68032 on \em all\em* the people¦68023 and¦68019 \add ≈make them¦68033 into\add* prophets¦68025.”
