\v 1 Then Yahweh¦68384 told Mosheh¦68387 \add !(Moses¦68387)\add*,
\v 2 “Send some men¦68393 in¦68414 to explore Kanaan¦68398—the land¦68397 that I'm¦68401 giving¦68402 to the \add ≈Israelis¦68403\add*. Send one¦68406 man¦68407 from each \add ≈ancestral¦68410\add* tribe—a leader¦68413 within that tribe.”
