\p
\v 16 Mosheh called¦68532 (Nun's¦68537 son¦68535) Hoshea¦68534, ‘Yehoshua¦68538’ \add !(Joshua)\add*. Those were the names¦68522 of¦68522 the men¦68523 that Mosheh sent¦68526 out¦68528 to¦68534 explore \add @Kanaan\add*.
