\v 31 \add ≈But¦68811\add* the¦68811 men¦68811 who'd gone¦68814 in with¦68815 him¦68815 \add ≈argued\add*, “\add No,\add*, we're¦68818 not¦68817 able¦68818 to¦68819 \add battle\add* against¦68820 them because¦68823 \add #they're\add* stronger¦68825 than¦68827 us¦68827.”
