\v 7 and spoke to¦68979 all¦68981 \add ≈those Israelis¦68984 gathered there\add*, “The¦68986 land¦68988 that¦68989 we¦68990 passed¦68990 throughout and explored¦68992 is¦68994 a very, very good¦68994 \add ≈place\add*.
