\v 9 However, you all mustn't rebel¦69024 against¦69021 Yahweh, and¦69025 you mustn't be scared of¦69031 the¦69032 people¦69031 in¦69021 that \add ≈area\add* because¦69033 they'll \add be like\add* bread¦69034 for us. \add ≈There's nothing left to protect¦69037 them¦69038 as\add* Yahweh is¦69040 with¦69021 us, \add so\add* don't¦69022 be afraid.”
\v 10 Then¦69045 the \add ≈mass of people¦69061 talked about¦69046 killing them by throwing rocks¦69051 at¦69051 them, but¦69045\add* Yahweh's¦69053 \add ≈brilliant light\add* \add suddenly\add* appeared¦69054 to¦69057 all¦69059 the \add ≈Israelis¦69061 from the sacred¦69055\add* tent¦69055.
