\p
\v 11 Yahweh¦69066 said¦69065 to Mosheh¦69069, “How long will this people¦69074 group spurn¦69073 me for? \add ≈How long will they¦69081 refuse to believe¦69081 in¦69082 me for\add*, \add ≈despite¦69073 all¦69083 the¦69084 miracles¦69084 that¦69085 I've done¦69086 among them\add*?
