\v 29 \add Indeed\add* you'll \add ≈die there\add* in the¦69383 wilderness¦69382—all those men who were listed as being twenty¦69393 years¦69394 old and older that¦69383 complained against¦69398 me¦69398.
\v 30 You all won't enter that land¦69406 that I¦69408 \add would have\add* \add ≈used my¦69411 power\add* to settle¦69412 you into¦69404. \add The only exceptions are\add* Yefunneh's¦69421 son Kalev¦69418 \add !(Caleb¦69418)\add* and¦69422 Nun's¦69425 son Yehoshua¦69422 \add !(Joshua¦69422)\add*.
