\v 33 Your sons will become shepherds¦69450 in the wilderness for forty¦69452 years¦69453, and¦69448 they¦69454 will suffer¦69454 for your unfaithfulness¦69457 until¦69458 you \add yourselves\add* all \add ≈become\add* corpses¦69461 in the wilderness.
\v 34 \add ≈For each day¦69473\add* that¦69466 you explored the land¦69471, you'll all \add ≈bear¦69478 your disobedience for one year¦69483\add*, so forty days¦69465 will be forty years¦69483 \add ≈of¦69487 experiencing\add* my¦69487 displeasure¦69487.
\v 35 I, Yahweh¦69490, have¦69491 spoken¦69491 that I'll¦69497 certainly do¦69497 that to¦69498 this¦69502 evil¦69501 community¦69500 that joined together¦69503 against¦69504 me¦69504. They'll meet¦69507 their¦69507 end¦69507 and¦69508 die¦69509 there¦69508 in¦69505 the¦69506 wilderness¦69505.’ ”
