\v 44 \add Nevertheless,\add* they¦69662 dared¦69649 to \add ≈continue\add* up¦69650 to the tops of¦69653 the hills, \add ≈but¦69649\add* \add neither\add* Mosheh¦69659 nor the box¦69655 \add ≈containing\add* the agreement¦69656 with Yahweh¦69658, left the camp¦69664.
