\v 2 “Tell the \add ≈Israelis¦69689\add* that when they \add ≈enter the region¦69697 that I'll give¦69701 them to live in\add*, \add they must do this:\add*
\v 3 \add When\add* you all make a gift to Yahweh—a burnt¦69707 offering or a sacrifice¦69710, to fulfill¦69711 a vow¦69713, or as a freewill¦69715 offering, or at¦69715 your appointed¦69717 times, to make a scent of pleasing¦69720 for Yahweh from the cattle or from the flock¦69728—
