\v 7 plus 1.2 litres of wine¦69767, all to be presented as a pleasing¦69774 aroma¦69772 to Yahweh¦69775.
\v 8 When¦69793 you¦69779 offer¦69779 a young¦69780 bull as a burnt¦69783 offering or as a sacrifice¦69786 such as fulfilling¦69787 a vow¦69789 or as a peace¦69792 offering,
