\v 24 then¦69993 \add ≈assuming that it was an accident\add*, the community¦70002 must¦69999 offer¦69999 a young bull¦70003 for a burnt¦70008 offering to make a pleasing¦70010 aroma¦70009 for Yahweh¦70011, along with its¦70012 grain¦70012 offering and¦69993 drink¦70013 offering as per the instructions, plus¦69999 a male¦70015 goat¦70015 as a sin¦70019 offering.
\v 25 \add That way\add* the priest¦70022 will make¦70021 atonement¦70021 for the \add ≈Israeli¦70028 community\add* and they'll be¦70030 forgiven¦70030 because it was a mistake and they'd brought¦70037 their gift as an offering to¦70042 Yahweh¦70042 plus¦70030 their sin¦70043 offering because of their mistake.
