\v 30 \add ≈However,\add* any person who¦70108 \add ≈disobeys defiantly\add*, whether native-born¦70116 or foreigner, they are slandering Yahweh¦70122 and¦70107 that person must¦70110 be \add ≈driven out of the community\add*
