\v 19 plus¦70662 Korah¦70651 had \add also\add* assembled¦70649 the entire¦70654 community \add ≈to oppose\add* \add @Mosheh and¦70662 Aharon\add* at the entrance¦70659 to the \add ≈sacred¦70660\add* tent¦70660. Then¦70649 Yahweh's¦70665 \add ≈brilliance\add* appeared¦70662 to all¦70668 the community
