\p
\v 1 Then¦73637 the \add ≈Israelis¦73639\add* set¦73637 off for the Moav¦73642 plains¦73641, and¦73640 they camped¦73640 there across the river from¦73643 Yeriho¦73645 \add !(Jericho¦73645)\add*.
