\v 22 \add ≈However,\add* God¦74047 \add ≈got angry\add* because¦74048 he'd gone¦74050, and¦74044 Yahweh's¦74054 messenger¦74053 \add ≈stood¦74052 in¦74055 the middle of the road¦74055 to block them\add*. \add ≈As\add* \add @Bileam\add* rode¦74059 on¦74055 his donkey¦74062, accompanied by his two¦74063 servants¦74064,
