\p
\v 25 Then Yahweh¦78461 told Mosheh¦78464 \add !(Moses¦78464)\add*,
\v 26 “You¦78474 and the priest¦78476 Eleazar¦78475 and the \add ≈tribal leaders\add* must \add ≈list all\add* the plunder \add ≈including¦78473 both\add* human¦78472 and animals that were taken captive¦78471.
\v 27 Then¦78481 you¦78481 must¦78481 divide¦78481 \add *it all\add* out \add equally between the two groups\add*: those¦78486 who¦78488 went¦78488 out to¦78489 battle¦78489, and¦78490 all \add the rest of\add* the community¦78493.
\v 28 \add ≈Set aside¦78495\add* a tribute¦78496 for¦78497 Yahweh¦78497 from \add the plunder of\add* the \add ≈warriors¦78499\add* who¦78501 fought in the battle¦78502: one¦78503 from every five-hundred \add captive\add* people, and \add ≡the same\add* from the cattle¦78512 and donkeys¦78515, and from the \add ≈sheep¦78518 and goats\add*.
\v 29 Half¦78520 of¦78520 that must¦78521 be given¦78522 to the priest¦78524 Eleazar¦78523 as the contribution¦78525 to Yahweh¦78526.
\v 30 Then¦78528 from the half¦78528 \add of the plunder\add* \add given\add* to the \add ≈community\add*, take¦78532 one from every fifty¦78539 \add captive\add* people¦78529, and \add ≡the same\add* from the cattle¦78545 and donkeys¦78548, and from the \add ≈sheep¦78551 and goats\add* and other animals. That's¦78531 to be given to the Levites¦78557 because they're the ones who look after Yahweh's¦78561 residence.”
\v 31 \add ≈So¦78563\add* Mosheh¦78564 and¦78565 the¦78566 priest¦78566 Eleazar¦78565 did what Yahweh¦78569 had¦78568 told¦78568 them to do.
\p
\v 32 The¦78575 remaining¦78576 plunder¦78579 \add after the slaughter of the boys and the married women\add* from what the warriors had¦78579 brought back was: 675,00 sheep¦78582,
\v 33 72,000 cattle¦78593,
\v 34 61,000 donkeys¦78598,
\v 35 and¦78603 32,000 girls \add ≈who¦78608 hadn't been married\add*.
