\v 37 \add ≈less\add* 675 that were given to Yahweh¦78641 \add as his tribute\add*.
\v 38 The¦78650 cattle¦78650 were¦78651 36,000 \add ≈less\add* 72 for¦78655 Yahweh¦78655.
\v 39 There were¦78660 30,500 donkeys¦78659 \add ≈less\add* Yahweh's¦78665 tribute¦78664 of¦78664 sixty-one¦78667.
\v 40 The¦78669 \add ≈girls and¦78669 young women\add* were¦78671 16,000 \add ≈less\add* 32 for¦78675 Yahweh¦78675.
\v 41 \add ≈So¦78680\add* Mosheh gave¦78680 Yahweh's¦78686 contribution¦78685 to¦78687 the¦78688 priest¦78688 Eleazar¦78687 as¦78689 Yahweh had¦78690 \add ≈instructed¦78690\add* Mosheh.
\p
\v 42 The¦78698 half¦78696 for the \add ≈community\add* that¦78699 Mosheh¦78701 had¦78700 divided¦78700 off from¦78702 the \add ≈warriors¦78704\add*
\v 43 was: 337,500 sheep¦78712,
