\p
\v 1 The¦78900 \add people\add* from the Reuven¦78901 and Gad¦78904 \add ≈tribes\add* \add had amassed\add* \add ≈a lot of¦78910\add* livestock, and they¦78907 \add ≈noticed¦78907\add* that the Yazer¦78911 and Gilead¦78915 \add ≈regions¦78910\add* \add ≈were very¦78898 suitable\add* for livestock.
