\v 13 \add ≈So¦79103\add* Yahweh \add ≈got angry with¦79107\add* Yisrael¦79107, and¦79108 made¦79108 \add ≈us\add* wander¦79108 in¦79107 the¦79105 wilderness¦79109 for forty¦79110 years¦79111 until¦79112 that¦79118 generation¦79117 was¦79114 \add ≈eliminated\add* who had¦79118 \add ≈been evil¦79119 as per Yahweh's¦79106 judgement\add*.
\v 14 \add ≈Now look here!\add* You're \add ≈standing in¦79125 front of me\add* \add just\add* like your parents—a brood¦79127 of \add ≈disobedient\add* people¦79128 who'll make Yahweh¦79136 more angry with you than he was with your parents!
