\p
\v 16 \add ≈However, they¦79157 stepped\add* closer to¦79156 him¦79156 and said¦79157, “\add First\add* we'll¦79160 build pens for our animals, and build cities¦79163 for our \add ≈families\add* \add here\add*.
\v 17 Then¦79166 we'll¦79167 equip¦79167 ourselves¦79167 for war, \add ≈to¦79169 go ahead of the¦79170 rest\add* of Yisrael¦79171 until¦79172 we've¦79176 brought¦79176 them¦79176 into their¦79179 place¦79179. \add ≈Meanwhile\add* our¦79181 \add ≈families\add* will¦79180 live in those fortified¦79183 cities¦79182 because \add ≈there'll still be threats from¦79184\add* those who live in \add ≈this region\add*.
