\v 26 “Our wives¦79310 and children, and our livestock¦79311 and all¦79312 our animals¦79314 will¦79315 remain in cities¦79318 here in the Gilead¦79319 \add region\add*,
\v 27 \add ≈but¦79321\add* we'll equip¦79325 ourselves for battle and¦79321 to cross¦79322 \add <the¦79327 river\add* to battle for Yahweh¦79328 just¦79330 as¦79330 my¦79331 master¦79331 has spoken¦79332.”
