\p
\v 39 The descendants¦79534 of Menashsheh's¦79538 son¦79536 Makir¦79535 went¦79533 to¦79539 Gilead¦79539 and¦79533 captured¦79540 it—driving out the¦79544 Amorites¦79544 who¦79545 \add ≈lived there\add*.
