\p
\v 1 \add @The following\add* are¦79591 \add the details\add* of the \add ≈stages of Yisrael's¦79594 journeys¦79591\add* \add starting from\add* when they¦79596 exited Egypt¦79598 \add ≈tribe-by-tribe\add* under Mosheh¦79602 and¦79603 Aharon's¦79603 leadership¦79600.
\v 2 Mosheh¦79606, \add ≈acting on Yahweh's¦79614 instructions\add*, had written¦79605 down¦79605 their \add ≈departure¦79609 points¦79609\add*, so these¦79615 were \add the legs of\add* their journeys¦79610:
\p
\v 3 The day after¦79628 \add they celebrated\add* the ‘pass-over¦79629’ \add ≈(around the end of March)\add*, they left¦79619 Rameses¦79620 city, raising¦79635 \add ≈one fist\add* in¦79621 full view of all¦79637 Egypt¦79639 \add (Heb. Mitsrayim)\add*.
