\v 34 Then¦79872 they left¦79872 Yotbatah¦79873 and¦79874 camped¦79874 at¦79875 Avronah¦79875.
\v 35 From¦79878 Avronah, they¦79879 \add went to\add* Etsyon-Gever and¦79879 camped¦79879 \add there\add*,
