\v 37 Then¦79893 they left¦79893 Kadesh¦79894 and¦79893 camped¦79895 at¦79896 Mt¦79897. Hor¦79896 by the border¦79898 with¦79896 Edom¦79900.
\p
\v 38 Aharon¦79903 \add !(Aaron¦79903)\add* the priest¦79904 \add ≈climbed\add* Mt¦79908. Hor¦79907 \add ≈following Yahweh's¦79912 instructions\add*, and¦79902 then¦79902 died¦79913 there¦79914 on¦79923 the 5th of the first¦79925 month¦79923, forty¦79916 years after¦79917 the \add ≈Israelis¦79920\add* had left Egypt¦79922.\x + \xo 33:38: \xt Num 20:22-28; Deu 10:6; 32:50.\x*
