\v 48 \add ≈After leaving\add* the Avarim mountains¦80001, they¦80003 \add ≈reached\add* the Moav¦80005 plains¦80004 by the Yarden¦80007 \add !(Jordan¦80007) river\add* \add ≈opposite\add* Yeriho¦80008 \add !(Jericho¦80008)\add*.
\v 49 They¦80010 camped¦80010 \add ≈beside\add* the \add *river\add* from¦80014 Beyt¦80014-Hayshimot to¦80016 Avel¦80017-Shittim \add there\add* on¦80019 the Moav¦80020 plains¦80019.
